## Open Source & Contributions

The current version of GhostRhythm uses Turkish terminal prompts, but since this is an **Open Source** project, I welcome global contributions!

If you want to:
- 🌍 Add multi-language support (English/etc.)
- 🧪 Improve the similarity algorithm (Machine Learning integration?)
- 💻 Port it to other operating systems

Feel free to **Fork** this repository and submit a **Pull Request**. Let's build the future of biometric security together!
